{'symbol': 'EL', 'date': '2023-05-24 16:40:00', 'title': 'THE ESTÉE LAUDER COMPANIES TO PARTICIPATE IN THE BERNSTEIN ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FABRIZIO FREDA, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND STÉPHANE DE LA FAVERIE, EXECUTIVE GROUP PRESIDENT, OF THE ESTÉE LAUDER COMPANIES INC. (NYSE: EL) WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE BERNSTEIN ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE IN NEW YORK ON THURSDAY, JUNE 1, 2023, AT 9:00 A.M. EST. INTERESTED PARTIES CAN ACCESS THE LIVE WEBCAST OF THE FIRESIDE CHAT ON THURSDAY, JUNE 1ST FROM 9:00 A.M. – 9:50 A.M. EST AT HTTP://WWW.ELCOMPANIES.COM/INVESTORS. THE WEBCAST WILL BE ARCHIV.'}